 "incoherences_sans_controle": "<div class=\"tab-bar\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn active\" data-tab=\"incoherences\">Brebis à régulariser</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"reproduction\">Bilan de reproduction</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"economique\">Bilan économique</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"lactation\">Bilan de lactation</button></div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);margin:2px 2px 14px;\">Ce qui reste à vérifier ou à corriger avant la clôture de la campagne en cours (2027).</div>\n\n    \n\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px;\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-amber\">À régulariser</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);\">3 brebis (50%)</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:8px;\">Ni mise bas, ni vide définitive enregistrée cette campagne — une échographie seule ne suffit pas à sortir une brebis de cette liste.</div>\n        <div>\n    <div class=\"bilan-eid-link\" data-id=\"f250016299930001\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);cursor:pointer;\">\n      <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">n°30001</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">3 an(s)</span>\n    </div>\n  \n    <div class=\"bilan-eid-link\" data-id=\"f250016299930002\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);cursor:pointer;\">\n      <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">n°30002</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">3 an(s)</span>\n    </div>\n  \n    <div class=\"bilan-eid-link\" data-id=\"f250016299960002\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content: