 "incoherences_tous_controles": "<div class=\"tab-bar\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn active\" data-tab=\"incoherences\">Brebis à régulariser</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"reproduction\">Bilan de reproduction</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"economique\">Bilan économique</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"lactation\">Bilan de lactation</button></div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);margin:2px 2px 14px;\">Ce qui reste à vérifier ou à corriger avant la clôture de la campagne en cours (2027).</div>\n\n    \n\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px;\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-amber\">À régulariser</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);\">3 brebis (50%)</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:8px;\">Ni mise bas, ni vide définitive enregistrée cette campagne — une échographie seule ne suffit pas à sortir une brebis de cette liste.</div>\n        <div>\n    <div class=\"bilan-eid-link\" data-id=\"f250016299930001\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);cursor:pointer;\">\n      <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">n°30001</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">3 an(s)</span>\n    </div>\n  \n    <div class=\"bilan-eid-link\" data-id=\"f250016299930002\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);cursor:pointer;\">\n      <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">n°30002</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">3 an(s)</span>\n    </div>\n  \n    <div class=\"bilan-eid-link\" data-id=\"f250016299960002\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);cursor:pointer;\">\n      <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">n°60002</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">0 an(s)</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n      </div><div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px;\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-green\">Ont mis bas</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);\">3 brebis (50%)</span>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div>\n    <div class=\"bilan-eid-link\" data-id=\"f250016299950001\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);cursor:pointer;\">\n      <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">n°50001</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">1 an(s)</span>\n    </div>\n  \n    <div class=\"bilan-eid-link\" data-id=\"f250016299950002\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);cursor:pointer;\">\n      <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">n°50002</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">1 an(s)</span>\n    </div>\n  \n    <div class=\"bilan-eid-link\" data-id=\"f250016299960001\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);cursor:pointer;\">\n      <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">n°60001</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">0 an(s)</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n      </div>\n  ",
 "lactation": "<div class=\"tab-bar\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"incoherences\">Brebis à régulariser</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"reproduction\">Bilan de reproduction</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"economique\">Bilan économique</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn active\" data-tab=\"lactation\">Bilan de lactation</button></div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin:2px 2px 10px;\"><span class=\"info-bulle-btn\" data-info-id=\"ib0\" title=\"Mode d'emploi\" style=\"cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;margin-left:6px;\">❔</span></div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">\n      <label>Campagne consultée</label>\n      <select id=\"bilan-lactation-campagne-select\">\n        <option value=\"2026\" selected=\"\">Campagne 2027</option><option value=\"2025\">Campagne 2026</option><option value=\"2024\">Campagne 2025</option><option value=\"2023\">Campagne 2024</option><option value=\"2022\">Campagne 2023</option><option value=\"2021\">Campagne 2022</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">\n      <label>Litrage total produit sur la campagne (L)</label>\n      <input type=\"number\" step=\"0.1\" id=\"bilan-lactation-litrage-total\" placeholder=\"ex: 78450\" value=\"4000\">\n      \n      <label style=\"display:block;margin-top:14px;\">Brebis passées à la traite</label>\n      <input type=\"number\" step=\"1\" id=\"bilan-lactation-brebis-traite\" placeholder=\"ex: 415\" value=\"3\">\n      \n      <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:8px;\">Litrage total pré-rempli automatiquement depuis le tank de Production laitière (modifiable si la saisie tank est incomplète). Brebis passées à la traite = toutes celles ayant eu au moins un contrôle laitier cette campagne, calculé automatiquement (modifiable au besoin).</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:10px;\">Campagne 2026 (N-1) : — · 1 brebis</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid2\">\n      <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">Litrage / brebis traite</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--blue-fg);\">1333,3 L</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:4px;\">N-1 : <b>—</b></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">Litrage / brebis présente</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--blue-fg);\">666,7 L</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:4px;\">N-1 : <b>—</b></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin:10px 0;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">Ratio brebis traites / brebis ayant mis bas</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:600;\">100,0 %</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:4px;\">3 traites ÷ 3 mises bas (Bilan de reproduction troupeau) — un ratio supérieur à 100 % est possible (des brebis restées vides ou achetées en lactation peuvent aussi être traites).</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:6px;\">N-1 : <b>—</b></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">\n      <label>Brebis présentes (moyenne de présence sur la campagne)</label>\n      <input type=\"number\" step=\"0.1\" id=\"bilan-lactation-brebis-presentes\" placeholder=\"ex: 380\" value=\"6\">\n      \n      <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:8px;\">Calculé automatiquement : moyenne mensuelle de l'effectif sur les 12 mois de la campagne (octobre à septembre), à partir de l'effectif de début de campagne, ajustée chaque mois selon les sorties ET les entrées survenues ce mois-là. Modifiable si tu as une connaissance terrain plus fine.</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:6px;\">N-1 : <b>6,0</b></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" id=\"btn-export-bilan-lactation-pdf\" style=\"flex:1;\">Export PDF</button>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" id=\"btn-export-bilan-lactation-xlsx\" style=\"flex:1;\">Export Excel</button>\n    </div>\n  ",
 "economique": "<div class=\"tab-bar\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"incoherences\">Brebis à régulariser</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"reproduction\">Bilan de reproduction</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn active\" data-tab=\"economique\">Bilan économique</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"lactation\">Bilan de lactation</button></div>\n    <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;align-items:end;\">\n      <div><label for=\"bilan-eco-campagne-select\">Campagne consultée</label><select id=\"bilan-eco-campagne-select\" style=\"margin-bottom:0;\"><option value=\"2026\" selected=\"\">Campagne 2027</option><option value=\"2025\">Campagne 2026</option><option value=\"2024\">Campagne 2025</option><option value=\"2023\">Campagne 2024</option><option value=\"2022\">Campagne 2023</option><option value=\"2021\">Campagne 2022</option></select></div>\n      <div><label for=\"btn-prix-coef\">Coefficient MSU</label><button type=\"button\" id=\"btn-prix-coef\" class=\"eco-coef\" aria-label=\"Modifier le coefficient MSU\"><span id=\"prix-coef-value\">12,1538</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-muted);\">✎</span></button></div>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"qualite-prix-coef-edit\" class=\"card hidden\">\n      <div id=\"prix-coef-heritage\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:8px;\"></div>\n      <label for=\"prix-ref-input\" style=\"margin-bottom:2px;\">Prix référence (€/1000L) — optionnel</label>\n      <input type=\"number\" step=\"0.01\" id=\"prix-ref-input\" placeholder=\"ex. 1580\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">\n      <label for=\"msu-ref-input\" style=\"margin-bottom:2px;\">MSU référence (g/L) — optionnel</label>\n      <input type=\"number\" step=\"0.01\" id=\"msu-ref-input\" placeholder=\"ex. 130\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">\n      <label for=\"prix-coef-input\" style=\"margin-bottom:2px;\">Coefficient MSU (€/1000L par point) — calculé si les 2 champs ci-dessus sont remplis, sinon à saisir directement</label>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;\"><input type=\"number\" step=\"0.0001\" id=\"prix-coef-input\" style=\"margin:0;\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" id=\"btn-prix-coef-save\" style=\"width:auto;padding:10px 16px;margin:0;\">OK</button></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\" id=\"eco-synthese\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">Campagne 2027 · montant avec qualité</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:700;margin:2px 0 6px;\" id=\"eco-montant-avec\">—</div>\n      \n      <div style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--border);\">\n        <div class=\"eco-lig\"><div><span style=\"color:var(--text-muted);\">Lait livré (tank)</span></div><div style=\"\">4&nbsp;000 L</div></div>\n        <div class=\"eco-lig\"><div>Montant hors qualité</div><div style=\"\">—</div></div>\n        <div class=\"eco-lig\"><div>Grades bactério</div><div style=\"\">—</div></div>\n        <div class=\"eco-lig\"><div>Bonus Super A</div><div style=\"\">—</div></div>\n        <div class=\"eco-lig\"><div>Pénalités bactério</div><div style=\"\">—</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid2\" style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:12px;margin-top:4px;\">\n        <div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">Prix moyen hors qualité</div><div style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:700;\">—</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">/ 1000 L</div></div>\n        <div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">Prix moyen avec qualité</div><div style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:700;\">—</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">/ 1000 L</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\" id=\"eco-mois\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px;\">Mois par mois</div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"pl-row eco-mois-tete\" data-cle=\"2026-12\" aria-expanded=\"false\" style=\"min-height:56px;\"><span style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;\">Décembre 2026</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">1&nbsp;500 L</span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;\">—</span><span class=\"eco-chev\" style=\"color:var(--text-muted);\">⌄</span></button><div class=\"eco-mois-corps hidden\" data-cle=\"2026-12\"><div class=\"eco-detail\" data-cle=\"2026-12\">\n      <div style=\"text-align:right;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">€ / 1000 L</div>\n      <div class=\"eco-lig\"><div style=\"color:var(--text-muted);\">Aucun prélèvement qualité ce mois : prix non calculable.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"eco-lig\"><div style=\"color:var(--text-muted);\">Volume livré</div><div>1&nbsp;500 L</div></div>\n      <div style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:6px;\"><div class=\"eco-lig\" style=\"min-height:40px;\"><div><div>Pénalités bactério</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">aucune ce mois</div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary eco-pen-add\" data-mois=\"2026-12\" style=\"width:auto;padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;\">+ Ajouter</button></div></div>\n      <div class=\"eco-lig\" style=\"border-top:2px solid var(--text);min-height:48px;\"><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\">Total du mois</div><div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700;\">—</div></div>\n      \n    </div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"pl-row eco-mois-tete\" data-cle=\"2027-01\" aria-expanded=\"false\" style=\"min-height:56px;\"><span style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;\">Janvier 2027</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">2&nbsp;500 L</span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;\">—</span><span class=\"eco-chev\" style=\"color:var(--text-muted);\">⌄</span></button><div class=\"eco-mois-co